    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνσχολάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spend one's leisure in</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1331b12
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>reside in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρόνησις ἐ. ψυχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.358
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spend time upon,</i>
			
